  {
   "id": "vampire-therapist-288502@post-2024-09-30",
   "gameId": "vampire-therapist-288502",
   "displayName": "It's Curtains For You",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-30T15:35:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings, children of the night!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've got a special new patch you all today. You know how Vampire Therapist has a reputation as \"that really cool and funny game with the wonky curtains?\" Well, now the curtains are fixed!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Why did it take this long? Well, Vampire Therapist is largely a solo project and I'm not an experienced programmer. Apparently embedding video with transparency will make most computers melt. So now we use a green screen effect to render the curtains opening and closing instead. Neat!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Further patch notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Updates the curtains to use a greenscreen — should work much better on slower machines!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ensures players can't save during Distortion picking. Sorry, my dear therapists, have confidence and commit to your choices!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lots of setup for upcoming content and upcoming demo",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's all this time. Thanks for your patience, bloodsucking buddies!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Love,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cyrus",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
